{"games":[{"id":140389387891344,"name":"[UPD] Escape Tower For Brainrots!","desc":"Climb up Tower and steal Brainrots! 🧗 \n\nRoblox Plus/ Premium Users Get 10x Luck 🍀\n\n[How To Play]\n• Enter tower and Steal a Brainrot\n• Return Brainrot to your plot to make cash\n• Upgrade your health to go further\n• Cash is made OFFLINE! 💤\n\n💰Remember, your BRAINROTS EARN CASH OFFLINE! 😴 ","path":"/game/140389387891344-escape-tower-for-brainrots","slug":"140389387891344-escape-tower-for-brainrots","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/486aa52cac622a34f0e609edfdcb9b2fa79d68b43a85c124fb3b521b4ae12a24.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-c474520275424b733bfaf14928fb748f/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":41,"visitor":11053431,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T03:20:32.704Z","creator":{"name":"PizzaWithABrainrot","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":113275514991402,"name":"👁️ Into The Abyss ","desc":"[ ⚠️ This Game is in Late Alpha, it will receive updates often. Expect Bugs! ]\n\n[ 👥 This Game is Suitable for 1-4 Players, and uses Proximity Text and Voice Chat ]\n\n[ 🎮 Controls ]\nE - Interact, Pick Up\nQ - Drop Item\nC - Crouch, Slide while running\nShift - Run, Door Bash\nSpace - Dodge Roll\n\n[ 📜 Story ]\nOnce a Government Funded Operation working on Harnessing Unlimited Power from Elusive Relics, A.R.C is Now Tasked with Cleaning Up their own Mistakes. Artifacts have been responsible for holding the rest of the facility up in shambles, as well as resurrecting lethal threats bent on stopping you.\n\nThe Target? The CORE Artifact. \nThe Abyss Divers? You. \nThe Transport? A Service Elevator.\n\nA.R.C is legally required to inform all Abyss Diver Candidates:\n\nＥｖｅｎ   Ｉｎ   Ｔｈｅ   Ａｂｙｓｓ， Ｙｏｕ   ａｒｅ   Ｎｏｔ   Ａｌｏｎｅ 👁️\n\nInspired by The Upturned, Lethal Company, Pressure, DESCENT, and Minus/Depth Spelunking","path":"/game/113275514991402-into-the-abyss","slug":"113275514991402-into-the-abyss","thumbnail":{"u